ent-WeaponRifleIroh = HWL FG.J "Iroh" (5.56x45mm)
    .desc = A premium, finely-tuned rifle. Accurate and fast-firing, this bastion of independence is the pride and joy of Caelestinus. Outfitted with Erebus rails on the handguard and carryhandle, and a threaded barrel for attachments.
ent-WeaponRifleJackdaw = CS CAWS-25 "Jackdaw" (6.35x40mm)
    .desc = For anything standing in the way of Caelestinus' hopes and dreams, the beginning of the end is heralded by the song of a Jackdaw. Unloads an entire magazine of 6.35x40mm caseless at an alarming rate when the trigger is even as much as lightly tapped. Crystalline-looking iron sights provide heavy magnification when aiming down sights. Don't drop it.
ent-WeaponSubMachineGunFirestarter = HWM CAW-20 "Firestarter" (4.6x30mm)
    .desc = An excellent fully-automatic SMG wielded by Caelestinus. Flings a hailstorm of bullets in the name of justice.
ent-WeaponLaserTurretRetribution = CWZS-2048 "Retribution"
    .desc = A result of the reverse-engineering efforts of Caelestinus and the apex of their military armaments programme. A heavy weapon designed to deliver a piercing beam for the heaviest of ship encounters in-sector, however it finds itself mostly neutralised by strong ship shielding.
    .suffix = Supercapital, T5
