ent-BannerCaelestinus = caelestinus banner
    .desc = A green banner depicting a torch held high by an unknown individual. There are two non-descript battle rifles mirrored and adjacent on each side of the previous visage. This is the logo of Caelestinus representing the strength to hold newfound liberty high.
